{
  "project": "井口真理子命案：她没能回家",
  "voice_id": "voice-03",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "井口真理子来台湾毕业旅行，却再也没能回家。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "ee2ce99b0c4ead7362292e45a54a0d14870fa46d3d3956e219317a0c6514e746",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "母亲久子带着女儿照片，跨海来到台湾寻人。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "98e80fbfb6fba5ef6b960ad0ec3cfdd1e25cfe5c9c36658d9b45c7c85078b6f7",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "时间回到一九九〇年四月，二十三岁的她独自抵台，旅程才开始。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "b62b8251acee52ca50927863b911dafbd9a34d3f882a9c6b9a16cde319ca3920",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "夜市人声热闹、锅气升起；她边尝小吃，边把见闻记进小本子。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "db0da3ec6a28d68805a042af61383efddc0264330bd5f84d80d865953c7febda",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "在台南，她认识了李姓计程车司机；对方接待过她，也邀她借住。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "8d6a501a2b504cac8e7899061be3a70d12cc9a99a417ef39bbbbee7d1da45be5",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "她写下明信片，向日本家人报平安，也留下旅途点滴。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "c5d7ea8289b0e8cbb35b996c622190359e0cd38f82da464682b135ebf5170328",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "四月七日清晨，司机送她到台南车站；她登上列车，驶向高雄。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "0df318108e5d15dd75de714fc184d55d446ba94a278fbce7cf76bf62f5a21066",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "车窗外，稻田渐渐退远；她手里的明信片，记着旅途日常。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "91721931bacf62c53df876e062bd44ab143975665a2b809a1050d28b49218ffd",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "她抵达高雄车站，独自走出站口；此后便没了消息。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "59504fdc4afa980b9e48358389b24b117fbe7bef0acb899d5fdf274209aaaf24",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "四月十八日，原定返日的航班起飞，她却没有登机。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "2d56dfdd29f428e5d6b1a33eaa45edff1d0dbcbbdb14187043cdbc8346bdcae0",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "四月二十五日，母亲久子带着女儿照片抵台，沿途打听她的下落。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "119242c560103bd3516f6f6171ac731f635db68f5a62019b54cdc9056590e4bb",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "等不到消息，她向警方求助；搜寻范围由台南一路延伸到高雄。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "3ec3cc4e1e52c74b8ec36d39e5970b85fb3ebf7268f5aff91a6e31d1effdbaae",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "李姓司机接受警方询问后获释；真理子的下落仍无从确认。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "b60d00cb371be932872095b86c9b0c205b22ab82f77242cc64b10509ff429ea2",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "墓园与甘蔗田反复搜过，仍找不到她的踪迹。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "af5e73b2c3ac8a0fd50757faebb21c824f2c07d312173f51b49633dceaa82f21",
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "次年三月，警方在高雄逮捕刘学强；追查终于有了突破。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "f53b783e0fc4aa75d05c0055ef78392c3da3fce6746b5df5f9ae5b678fd6e800",
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "他供称，自己在车站看见真理子，随后主动上前搭话。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "0ef1632af64a4b8d8a7f019880843c4d0e7def77526e0375f8d9eb7264422145",
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "他还说，白天带她去过景点；每个细节仍要逐一核实。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "872cb5c10ca7238958c59e6ae5d8f5cf486a6c9c3c4ee5d4e3d01e2b5db9bf6b",
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "他的说法几度变化，警方只好重新核对每条线索。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "7a21d255a33f065a83d48011d5d4870fc5c3a1b3f84245075d730e6c1c3a674a",
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "那只深蓝色背包，也成了这个故事里另一个没有答案的问号。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "663c688e43a36aeedaf0535378e7a2252d0c3a09573f4080e37c755c5ab68356",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "每报出一个新地点，警员就得立即出发；搜寻一再落空。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "871f652ec07ba74430af669d61b203d4cf04018d882dc09552716559aec1e41f",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "深夜，警车循着新线索驶进小巷。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "639f97dbf58d47e9df085946d3cc893120ab5aefc68ad774dab469b43001465d",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "又一处线索落空，天快亮了，搜寻仍没有停下来。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "0a216813ce0680e27f9249c78a972172a8aba49fef601333fea220cea5797694",
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "三月七日深夜，组长王家儒决定自己留下来，再和他单独谈一次。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "d3ad723f929402bf17402d66c81c64f289e0c29118fb4e4bdec55443d7278e1f",
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "警车整夜往返台南、高雄，路灯从车窗掠过，天色渐渐发亮。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "c864303de40f6450d9b79472dc478ebf427f16d434badfbfa3bbc6ffe081deb6",
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "王家儒回忆，谈到儿子时，对方沉默良久，终于说出地点。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "f795fc698639160fd2da2ab573ca117d77e669a1589cb1e2544e0e408a393889",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "三月九日清晨，警方在那片土地挖掘，发现一百多块骨骸。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "1241046a1f2a1e1bf72134c1025b08cf67dc722574fad601913f038e554d649c",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "确认身份后，母亲后来见到女儿遗物；漫长等待，终于有了结果。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "cc49cff7fc793812c93a6b11f9324cd77625856ed2feb97ea6407cca9a6b15e7",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "他供称，头颅被垃圾车运走；相关搜寻最终停止。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "378ba6c3de94d061562efa87546d50b8f850aebe026f32b1191c4c9386adfc7a",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "刘学强被判无期；一九九三年，母亲带着女儿骨灰回到日本。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "b05e38a5e2a0cbd0aa36c2c1dec2c2207a87db9868ccf5fddd95a4c61906ae75",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "旅程结束，留下的疑问仍未解开。",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "sha256": "65de7a0a9fba00a24fdb2db12f53d24329498f868e8078bde848645bb41cef48",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "ready"
    }
  ],
  "target_duration": 180,
  "alignment": "one sentence per Agnes clip"
}
